{"title":"2018 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A bucket that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> full contains 9 L of maple syrup. What is the capacity of the bucket, in litres?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the bucket has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e8109238bea7142c01601121d68b8ef4a42cc552.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\text { L}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"14\" /> of maple syrup when it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> full, it must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7ce71aa7fde15fc42f5260f2c9245c1c1c1a6731.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{2} \\text { L}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"31\" height=\"38\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee61e02f97ee7084c49a0222ec9982dbccc45df9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.5 \\text { L}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" />, of maple syrup when it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> full.\n</p><p>This means that it must have a capacity of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/7/aa7c951b49c576eaf30ae66bc25e973ab8877786.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.5 \\text { L} \\times 3 = \\boxed{13.5 \\text{ L}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"156\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC\">2018 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_1\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 1\">Team Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_3\" title=\"2018 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 3\">Team Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CE